# ── MARK LV — what never belongs in the repository ──────────────────────────
# Everything listed here is created by the app on first run. A fresh clone with
# none of it present boots straight to the setup screen, which is the intended
# first experience — so nothing here needs to be committed, and some of it must
# never be.

# ── Secrets. Committing any of these publishes them. ──────────────────────────
# your Gemini API key, plus per-plugin credentials
config/api_keys.json
# the dashboard's TLS private key and certificate
config/certs/
# a LINKED WhatsApp session — committing it hands
config/whatsapp_web/
# Google OAuth tokens (Gmail / Calendar plugins)
**/token*.json
# Google OAuth client secrets
**/client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
.env
.env.*

# ── Personal data the assistant accumulates about you ─────────────────────────
memory/long_term.json
memory/*.db

# ── Python build noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/

# ── Virtual environments ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ── Editors and operating systems ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Runtime output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
downloads/
screenshots/

# ── ATENA — downloads, personal state and local-only folders ─────────────────
# wake-word model (~50 MB, downloaded by the app)
config/vosk-model-*/
config/*.zip
# per-day launch counter
config/launches.json
# RVC runtime (several GB, from instalar_voz.bat)
voice_engine/rvc/
voice_engine/*.7z
# personal voice models
voices/**/*.pth
voices/**/*.index
# local backups made while customising
_backup/
Claude outputs/
# game-mode saved state
config/modo_jogo.json
# spoken reminders
config/lembretes.json
# daily activity log (end-of-day summary)
config/uso/
# personal agenda
config/agenda.json
# e-mail contacts
config/contatos.json
# e-mail contacts (text file)
config/contatos.txt
